  "URGENT": "DRINGEND",
  "[HOST_COMPANY]\n[HOST_ADDRESS]\n\n[DATE] — URGENT VISIT INVITATION\n\nDear [GUEST_NAME],\n\nWe are writing to urgently invite you to visit [HOST_COMPANY] in [CITY], China, from [START_DATE] to [END_DATE].": "[HOST_COMPANY]\n[HOST_ADDRESS]\n\n[DATUM] — DRINGENDE BESUCHSEINLADUNG\n\nSehr geehrte/r [GUEST_NAME],\n\nwir möchten Sie hiermit dringend zu einem Besuch bei [HOST_COMPANY] in [CITY], China, vom [START_DATE] bis [END_DATE] einladen.",
  "Reason for Urgency": "Grund für die Dringlichkeit",
  "Reason for Urgency: [URGENCY_REASON]\n\nPurpose: [PURPOSE]\n\nYour contact: [CONTACT_NAME], [CONTACT_PHONE], [CONTACT_EMAIL]": "Grund für die Dringlichkeit: [URGENCY_REASON]\n\nZweck: [PURPOSE]\n\nIhr Ansprechpartner: [CONTACT_NAME], [CONTACT_PHONE], [CONTACT_EMAIL]",
  "Please confirm your travel dates at your earliest convenience so we can arrange your itinerary.\n\nBest regards,\n[HOST_SIGNATURE]\n[HOST_TITLE]\n[HOST_COMPANY]": "Bitte bestätigen Sie Ihre Reisedaten so bald wie möglich, damit wir Ihre Reiseroute arrangieren können.\n\nMit freundlichen Grüßen\n[HOST_SIGNATURE]\n[HOST_TITLE]\n[HOST_COMPANY]",
